      ],
      "name": "Ab roll out",
      "notes": "1. **Starting Position**: Kneel on the floor with the ab wheel in front of you.\n2. **Grip the Wheel**: Hold the handles firmly.\n3. **Roll Out**: Slowly roll the wheel forward, extending your body while keeping your core tight.\n4. **Return**: Pull the wheel back towards your knees, maintaining tension in your core.",
